      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `fa6720dbe3f5a958b61e9898c26171fa5c1336bbd35c0c784eabda51663d1cfd--4.-Aboriginal-and-Torres-Strait-Islander-victims-of-crime-selected-states-and-territories-Tables-23-to-28-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2022\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d51e788488c622d7f4ef23d850633a97ee489d2a3a903b5a1753595f1ddf1cfd | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | ef99af355f2d599412664848561058797d750ca0f05b65f7357f56cfa426fc6c | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | 425eaeb88f94c7ac551481284788f2d2c882dcc73a33481e9c9f584a30b723a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | 9ccd41a3210e9be35056360c8db6a4effc6910285242cc03e7b314307b06ebc0 | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | b40272628821113f9767c4f12a149d4ea9d13eadf97c5a6c01c9f30c19a1c598 | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | 848360541de5f9f40cd109a2ef3b0cf798d1102320da7f03033bb995a7779c20 | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | 76e582ab6e86347563d680874121f09d44984e9449d3f4bd3f639ffa079b7d13 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
